Z||000007||mrfiero||08-21-2001||11:11 PM||||There are a couple of issues with the car that precludes me from buying it (aside from a lack of funds)......<P>First item is it's stance.  They lowered the front, but didn't touch the rear.  As a result it looks awkward.  I know this would be an easy thing to fix, but still.....it should already be done.<P>Next is the choice of wheels.  I really don't like the 80's Ferrari knock off look......they're too "thick" looking on a Fiero.  This is another item that can be "fixed", but at a cost.<P>The final thing I don't care for is the paint.  They should have painted it monochromatic......get rid of the silver bottom!     <P>So, if I bought it I would have to spend another few grand on "fixing it"......I'd probably leave the paint alone, but lowering the rear and adding a nice set of 17" wheels would be a must.<P><BR>That's my opinion. ||||reg||1
Z||000008||Black88GT||08-21-2001||11:33 PM||||I don't like it.  The top looks disproportionate to the bottom.  It looks funny to me, and I also don't like the wheels/front squat.  ||||reg||1
